  <text decls="#source_1">
    <body>
      <div facs="#zone_headline">
        <head><hi rendition="#c"><lb/><hi rendition="#i #larger">The</hi> <name type="brand"><hi rendition="#g #larger">HEINTZMAN</hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#in">Welte-Mignon</hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#smaller">(Licensee)</hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#b #larger">Reproducing Piano</hi></name></hi></head>
      </div>
      <div type="illustration" facs="#zone_picture">
        <figure xml:id="figure_1" ana="#home"><desc>A grand piano in a room, a framed portrait of a seventeenth-century gentleman on the wall, a side table with a lamp and a vase</desc></figure>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_text">
        <p><lb/>With the <name type="brand">Heintzman Welte-Mignon</name> in your
          <lb/>home, <seg xml:id="topic_1" ana="#virtual_presence" type="topic" resp="#claude">you can have the companionship of the
          <lb/>world’s greatest pianists</seg>. <seg xml:id="topic_2" ana="#touch_of_a_button" type="topic" resp="#claude"><persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118986724">Paderewski</persName>, <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/116014490">De Pach-
          <lb/>mann</persName>, <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/11918625X"><sic>Hoffman</sic></persName> and a host of others await your
          <lb/>beck and call</seg>. Though they cannot appear in
          <lb/>person, <seg xml:id="topic_3" ana="#virtual_presence" type="topic" resp="#claude">their spirit will pervade the room</seg>—<seg xml:id="topic_4" ana="#exact_reproduction" type="topic" resp="#claude">so
          <lb/>exact is <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon</name> reproduction</seg>. The <name type="brand">Welte-
          <lb/>Mignon</name> is <seg xml:id="topic_5" ana="#unreached_ideal" type="topic" resp="#claude">the ultimate in musical perfection—
          <lb/>it is the outstanding and supreme instrument in
          <lb/>its field</seg>.</p>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_invitation">
        <ab><hi rendition="#c #i"><lb/>Come to our Salon and let it
          <lb/>entertain you. Catalogue on
          <lb/>request.</hi></ab>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_signature">
        <ab><hi rendition="#c"><lb/><hi rendition="#b #i">Ye Olde Firme</hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#in #larger"><orgName>Heintzman &amp; Co.</orgName></hi>
          <lb/><address><addrLine>193-197 Yonge Street, - - Toronto.</addrLine></address></hi></ab>
      </div>
    </body>
